          "exampleId": "w:confidence#e-7a6826f59063a3f4",
          "text": "One method the team suggests to arrest such decline is to have AI itself encourage further questioning in users, with developers adjusting responses to encourage reflection, asking questions like “how confident are you in this answer?”, or otherwise promoting further interaction through measures like confidence scores.",
